# Copy to `.env` next to docker-compose.yml and edit. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# The public hostname of this server. Its DNS A record must point at this host before the
# first `docker compose up`, and ports 80 and 443 must be reachable from the internet:
# Caddy obtains the certificate for it automatically. IPv4 only — do NOT publish an AAAA
# record (docs/SERVER-GUIDE.md Part 2 §2: IPv6 clients would all share one address).
LOOM_DOMAIN=loom.example.com
